<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title || 'Two-Factor Authentication Setup' %></title>
    <link rel="shortcut icon" href="/assets/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/navbar.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <script src="https://kit.fontawesome.com/21a1c82f31.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        .setup-container {
            padding: 2rem;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 120px auto 80px;
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        
        .setup-container h1 {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: #333;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }
        
        .setup-container p {
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .qr-container {
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            display: inline-block;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        
        .qr-container img {
            border: 8px solid white;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .secret-key {
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            background-color: #f3f3f3;
            padding: 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            word-break: break-all;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }
        
        .instructions {
            text-align: left;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
        }
        
        .instructions h2 {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .instructions ol {
            margin-left: 2rem;
            color: #555;
        }
        
        .instructions li {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        
        .instructions li a {
            color: #ff6634;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .instructions li a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .verification-form {
            margin: 2rem 0;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
        }
        
        .verification-form h3 {
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #444;
        }
        
        .verification-code {
            letter-spacing: 6px;
            font-family: monospace;
            font-size: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 180px;
            margin: 1rem auto;
            display: block;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .alert-message {
            background-color: #f8d7da;
            color: #721c24;
            padding: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            border-left: 4px solid #dc3545;
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .required-badge {
            background-color: #dc3545;
            color: white;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 0.8rem;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        
        .btn {
            background-color: #ff6634;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #e55a2b;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .back-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            color: #666;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .back-link:hover {
            color: #ff6634;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .setup-container {
                padding: 1.5rem;
                margin: 100px 15px 50px;
            }
            
            .setup-container h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            
            .secret-key {
                font-size: 1rem;
                padding: 0.6rem;
            }
            
            .verification-code {
                width: 160px;
                font-size: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <!-- Include navbar -->
    <%- include('./partials/header') %>

    <div class="setup-container">
        <h1>Set Up Two-Factor Authentication <span class="required-badge">Required</span></h1>
        <p>For enhanced security, two-factor authentication is required for all users.</p>
        
        <% if (typeof alert !== 'undefined' && alert) { %>
            <div class="alert-message">
                <%= alert %>
            </div>
        <% } %>
        
        <div class="instructions">
            <h2>Follow these steps:</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>Download and install the Google Authenticator app on your mobile device
                    <div>
                        <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.google.android.apps.authenticator2" target="_blank">Android</a> | 
                        <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/google-authenticator/id388497605" target="_blank">iOS</a>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>Open the Google Authenticator app</li>
                <li>Tap the + button and select "Scan a QR code"</li>
                <li>Scan the QR code below with your device's camera</li>
                <li>Enter the 6-digit verification code from the app to confirm setup</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
        
        <div class="qr-container">
            <img src="<%= qrCode %>" alt="QR Code for 2FA" width="200" height="200">
        </div>
        
        <p>If you can't scan the QR code, enter this secret key manually:</p>
        <div class="secret-key"><%= secret %></div>
        
        <div class="verification-form">
            <form action="/auth/enable-2fa" method="POST">
                <h3>Verify Setup</h3>
                <p>Enter the 6-digit verification code from your authenticator app:</p>
                
                <input type="text" id="token" name="token" class="verification-code" required 
                    placeholder="000000" maxlength="6" minlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code">
                
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Verify and Complete Setup</button>
            </form>
        </div>
        
        <div>
            <a href="/settings" class="back-link">&larr; Back to settings</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Include footer -->
    <%- include('./partials/footer') %>
</body>

</html> 